{
  "version": 1,
  "_notes": [
    "Hand-curated knowledge base for the Settings Assistant. The agent (keyword or LLM) may only pick an id + action from here.",
    "tier: direct = Kotlin changes it, panel = a system panel (or the phone's own screen, e.g. vivo's cleaner) opens right away, guide = steps + deep link, info = read-only facts about the phone (the button opens guide.intents).",
    "actions: the first one is the default when the query has no direction ('flashlight' -> on).",
    "guide.intents: tried in order until one resolves. All were checked with `pm resolve-activity` on the iQOO (OriginOS 6).",
    "guide.steps: OriginOS menu labels are NOT verified yet."
  ],
